[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4652263224","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119895#issuecomment-4652263224","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119895","id":4652263224,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFUvnOA","user":{"login":"mystico53","id":13587238,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTg3MjM4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13587238?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mystico53","html_url":"https://github.com/mystico53","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mystico53/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mystico53/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mystico53/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mystico53/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mystico53/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mystico53/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mystico53/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mystico53/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mystico53/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-08T18:42:07Z","updated_at":"2026-06-08T18:42:07Z","body":"Confirming this on **Windows 10 (x86_64), Godot 4.6** — same root cause.\n\n`godot --headless --export-debug \"Android\" out.apk` with a fully configured Android preset (valid SDK, JDK 21, keystore, installed debug templates) fails with the blank `configuration errors:` message and no further text, making it undiagnosable from the CLI.\n\nTraced it to the same spot: `should_import_etc2_astc()` returning `false` (in my case because **Import ETC2 ASTC** was disabled), after which `export_plugin.cpp` appends an empty error string to the list — hence the blank line.\n\n**Workaround that fixed it locally:** enable `rendering/textures/vram_compression/import_etc2_astc` in Project Settings and reimport textures. The Android preset then validates and exports fine.\n\nPR #119806 looks like it addresses the silent-message side of this by adding the missing console-mode error — might be worth cross-linking it here.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4652263224/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4652389315","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119895#issuecomment-4652389315","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119895","id":4652389315,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFU3Tww","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-08T18:56:13Z","updated_at":"2026-06-08T18:56:13Z","body":"Fixed by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117341","author_as